WEBVTT

01:40.259 --> 01:42.920
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.160 --> 01:45.990
[Episode 16]

01:47.920 --> 01:48.720
Zhu Yan.

01:50.710 --> 01:51.590
Don't forget.

01:53.420 --> 01:56.509
It was you who led me out of the Wilderness.

01:59.440 --> 02:02.820
Only then did I get to see the vast world.

02:03.690 --> 02:05.760
The mortal world is noisy and bustling.

02:05.760 --> 02:07.090
What's so good about it?

02:07.540 --> 02:08.740
Why must we come here?

02:10.870 --> 02:13.110
And every time I accompany you to the mortal world,

02:13.110 --> 02:14.440
I have to get this stamp.

02:15.110 --> 02:16.100
It's so annoying.

02:16.100 --> 02:16.750
Hey,

02:16.750 --> 02:17.440
look.

02:18.040 --> 02:19.160
What's this?

02:20.910 --> 02:24.070
♫The trees and grass of the world sway with the wind♫

02:21.510 --> 02:22.920
It looks really pretty.

02:24.070 --> 02:24.750
Dear customer,

02:24.130 --> 02:27.410
♫Beneath the bodhi tree, dust gathers♫

02:24.750 --> 02:26.070
this is not a hairpin.

02:29.450 --> 02:32.360
♫The good old days are gone for good like that lantern in my dream♫

02:32.430 --> 02:35.900
♫See immortals enter Penglai♫

02:33.590 --> 02:34.520
Let's go back.

02:34.770 --> 02:36.170
What's so fun about this?

02:36.460 --> 02:37.800
This is so much fun!

02:36.990 --> 02:40.450
♫The northern wind blows from beyond the mountains♫

02:37.880 --> 02:40.079
You can't find these in the Wilderness.

02:40.840 --> 02:41.680
Who cares?

02:41.360 --> 02:44.430
♫Along the icy river, it drifts into my dreams♫

02:42.430 --> 02:43.790
Sir, this is a paper windmill.

02:43.790 --> 02:45.390
It spins when the wind blows.

02:45.550 --> 02:48.640
♫Drinking wine at the Tongque Terrace♫

02:46.120 --> 02:48.850
-Humans are so smart.
-Human are so incompetent.

02:49.620 --> 02:52.079
♫Even the stars feel close enough to touch♫

02:52.140 --> 02:56.250
♫Life and death happen in an instant, but love and hate can endure for a long time♫

02:53.980 --> 02:55.900
They go to all this trouble to make such things

02:55.900 --> 02:57.120
just to play with the wind.

02:56.500 --> 02:59.760
♫Beyond cause and effect♫

02:57.550 --> 02:58.860
In the Wilderness,

02:59.300 --> 03:01.580
most of us demons could do this with just a breath.

03:00.630 --> 03:04.410
♫The heavens endure, the world remains eternal♫

03:02.030 --> 03:03.830
That's why I say they're clever.

03:04.470 --> 03:05.560
Without magical powers,

03:04.850 --> 03:08.670
♫Rock and moss♫

03:05.670 --> 03:07.930
they can still come up with such methods.

03:08.360 --> 03:10.250
Why are you always taking their side?

03:09.440 --> 03:10.560
♫Are watching♫

03:10.620 --> 03:13.640
♫A lone boat drifts through the vast world, vanishing into mist♫

03:10.990 --> 03:12.150
Why not?

03:13.690 --> 03:16.690
♫Its sound fading away♫

03:17.930 --> 03:18.770
♫I wish♫

03:18.840 --> 03:21.970
♫The sorrow of parting stayed beyond the river, and that we did not share the same mountain and moon♫

03:22.020 --> 03:25.840
♫Deep love, yet fate runs shallow♫

03:41.350 --> 03:43.010
Heaven and Earth are divided.

03:44.470 --> 03:46.530
Since they are two different realms,

03:46.990 --> 03:49.720
they must follow their respective natural laws.

03:50.990 --> 03:52.650
Humans are born ignorant,

03:53.230 --> 03:55.090
so they need to learn principles.

03:55.990 --> 03:57.850
Demons are naturally combative,

03:58.829 --> 04:00.490
so they need to be restrained.

04:01.270 --> 04:02.900
Baize Goddess.

04:04.680 --> 04:07.110
I'm tired of your

04:07.550 --> 04:09.050
hypocritical words.

04:09.760 --> 04:11.580
Subject all things to freedom

04:11.710 --> 04:13.550
and natural selection.

04:13.790 --> 04:15.270
That's the right way.

04:19.110 --> 04:20.029
Li Lun.

04:20.870 --> 04:22.550
Have you ever thought that

04:22.990 --> 04:24.920
once the Wilderness is destroyed,

04:24.990 --> 04:27.070
the lesser demons with weak spiritual energy

04:27.070 --> 04:29.910
won't be able to take human form at all?

04:29.990 --> 04:31.520
Along with the Wilderness,

04:31.680 --> 04:34.320
they will be doomed too.

04:36.300 --> 04:38.159
The great path is hard to achieve.

04:39.880 --> 04:42.290
Sacrifices are inevitable.

04:43.460 --> 04:45.750
Once the Star Formation collapses,

04:45.990 --> 04:47.390
it will be beyond repair.

04:48.970 --> 04:50.150
Zhao Yuanzhou,

04:51.700 --> 04:53.030
your doomsday has come.

04:55.760 --> 04:57.020
I know.

05:21.430 --> 05:22.360
If you don't die,

05:22.870 --> 05:24.680
I can't possibly die before you.

05:25.510 --> 05:26.310
Alright.

05:27.510 --> 05:29.590
Please make sure you keep your word.

05:29.870 --> 05:31.040
Let me die first.

05:32.830 --> 05:33.630
Ying Lei.

05:34.390 --> 05:35.980
I'm counting on you tomorrow.

05:35.980 --> 05:37.580
The future of the Wilderness

05:37.670 --> 05:38.800
is in your hands now.

05:41.590 --> 05:42.990
I will do my best.

05:43.220 --> 05:44.190
But

05:45.030 --> 05:46.430
I still can't believe it.

05:48.120 --> 05:51.010
Zhu Yin and my grandpa were close friends for so many years.

05:51.010 --> 05:52.170
Why would he also...

05:54.090 --> 05:55.500
When I first met Zhu Yin,

05:56.610 --> 05:58.250
I saw that his whole body

05:58.280 --> 06:01.210
was surrounded by an unrelenting malicious energy.

06:03.880 --> 06:05.470
No one knows about malicious energy

06:05.470 --> 06:07.460
better than I do.

06:11.910 --> 06:12.960
Mr. Zhuo.

06:13.330 --> 06:14.530
Ying Lei's safety

06:14.560 --> 06:15.690
is in your hands now.

06:17.010 --> 06:18.220
But remember,

06:18.470 --> 06:20.060
don't come too early.

06:20.780 --> 06:22.250
I still want to hear

06:22.270 --> 06:24.330
what they're really up to.

06:26.650 --> 06:28.150
Then how do I judge if it's early

06:28.150 --> 06:28.990
or not?

06:45.750 --> 06:47.020
Wait for my signal.

07:10.510 --> 07:12.160
Ying Lei, go quickly!

07:12.670 --> 07:13.500
Mr. Zhuo,

07:13.530 --> 07:14.790
take care of yourself.

07:24.790 --> 07:25.590
Grandpa!

07:28.940 --> 07:29.780
I'm here!

07:29.840 --> 07:30.750
Form the array.

07:31.110 --> 07:32.590
The stars align

07:32.700 --> 07:34.210
to stabilize the universe.

07:34.210 --> 07:35.120
Protect!

07:53.950 --> 07:54.940
Zhu Yin.

07:55.450 --> 07:56.650
Who said

07:56.670 --> 07:58.790
I could only struggle alone?

07:59.300 --> 08:00.630
Have you forgotten that

08:00.870 --> 08:03.430
I still have a Mountain God here?

08:33.669 --> 08:34.640
Mr. Zhuo,

08:34.909 --> 08:36.370
you're indeed reliable.

09:34.500 --> 09:36.430
The Ancient Dragon God.

09:36.950 --> 09:39.000
When it opens its eyes, it's daytime.

09:39.000 --> 09:41.260
When it closes its eyes, it's nighttime.

09:48.670 --> 09:50.850
It seems you've finally realized it.

09:51.940 --> 09:53.080
Wen Xiao.

09:54.360 --> 09:56.300
You've read thousands of books,

09:57.400 --> 09:59.310
how did you not foresee this?

10:00.950 --> 10:03.670
Zhu Yin can not only summon wind and rain,

10:03.950 --> 10:06.530
and illuminate the nine dark and mysterious lands,

10:06.530 --> 10:09.310
but also control the alternation of day and night,

10:09.310 --> 10:10.520
making the night

10:10.590 --> 10:12.320
arrive early.

10:24.070 --> 10:25.230
Look,

10:32.520 --> 10:34.190
isn't this blood moon

10:35.060 --> 10:38.930
more beautiful than the bright moon of the mortal world?

12:05.570 --> 12:06.660
Jiu.

12:07.050 --> 12:07.980
How are you?

12:08.010 --> 12:09.020
Sister Pei.

12:10.710 --> 12:13.600
Who were those people just now?

12:14.620 --> 12:16.220
They were from Chongwu Camp.

12:16.610 --> 12:18.200
People from Chongwu Camp?

12:18.720 --> 12:19.760
What do they want?

12:22.270 --> 12:23.190
I don't know.

12:24.290 --> 12:26.500
I was about to ask them what they were doing

12:26.500 --> 12:27.770
when you appeared.

12:29.900 --> 12:30.960
Jiu?

12:39.120 --> 12:40.120
Sister Pei!

12:41.470 --> 12:43.500
Then I was knocked unconscious.

12:50.100 --> 12:51.130
The blood moon.

13:34.920 --> 13:36.070
Zhao Yuanzhou...

13:37.200 --> 13:38.330
Zhao Yuanzhou!

13:44.200 --> 13:45.830
He's being controlled by the malicious energy!

13:45.830 --> 13:46.560
Great Demon!

13:46.860 --> 13:47.990
Great Demon Zhu Yan!

13:56.080 --> 13:56.880
Zhu Yin,

13:57.350 --> 13:58.630
take action.

13:58.790 --> 14:00.420
Destroy the Baize Token.

14:01.010 --> 14:03.130
Break through the shackles of two realms.

14:03.130 --> 14:04.490
Our goal

14:04.520 --> 14:06.230
is about to be realized.

16:54.360 --> 16:55.570
This is bad.

16:55.710 --> 16:58.150
Li Lun's seal has been broken.

17:37.220 --> 17:38.940
Don't get it wrong.

17:39.120 --> 17:41.060
Your enemy now

17:41.200 --> 17:42.650
is not me.

18:30.510 --> 18:31.990
Blindness.

18:51.130 --> 18:52.130
Zhao Yuanzhou...

18:52.320 --> 18:53.260
Snap out of it.

19:07.550 --> 19:08.640
Zhao Yuanzhou!

19:08.830 --> 19:09.960
Snap out of it!

19:10.390 --> 19:11.190
Ying Lei!

19:11.630 --> 19:12.420
Alright!

19:57.830 --> 19:58.830
Lady Goddess,

19:58.830 --> 19:59.760
hurry and leave!

20:03.720 --> 20:04.800
Look.

20:06.240 --> 20:08.070
This is his true self.

20:11.040 --> 20:13.500
Now that the Baize Token has been destroyed,

20:14.850 --> 20:17.780
Zhao Yuanzhou's malicious energy is out of control.

20:19.830 --> 20:22.870
Prepare for bloodshed in the mortal world.

20:52.090 --> 20:53.750
Why did you teach me?

20:54.390 --> 20:55.870
Didn't I tell you?

20:55.950 --> 20:57.370
I want you to kill me.

21:01.320 --> 21:02.690
I, Zhuo Yichen,

21:03.840 --> 21:05.630
swear to the heavens.

21:07.420 --> 21:08.710
As long as Zhu Yan teaches me

21:08.710 --> 21:10.970
the true way to use the Cloud Light Sword,

21:12.850 --> 21:15.420
I will surely slay him with my blade.

21:17.940 --> 21:19.160
If I break this oath,

21:20.880 --> 21:22.680
may heaven and earth destroy me,

21:23.110 --> 21:24.910
and my soul scatter to the winds.

21:25.760 --> 21:27.000
Zhuo,

21:27.170 --> 21:28.900
this isn't his true intention.

21:29.730 --> 21:32.130
He's just controlled by malicious energy.

21:33.370 --> 21:34.520
If I don't kill him,

21:35.890 --> 21:37.500
everyone will die.

21:43.470 --> 21:44.850
Interesting.

21:46.360 --> 21:48.180
You're in a dilemma.

21:48.620 --> 21:50.510
How will you choose?

21:51.730 --> 21:53.530
Baize Goddess,

21:54.670 --> 21:57.150
you're so protective of Zhao Yuanzhou.

21:58.790 --> 22:00.510
But do you know

22:01.260 --> 22:03.540
that he is also your enemy?

22:05.630 --> 22:08.320
Your master, Zhao Wan'er,

22:09.600 --> 22:12.380
was killed by Zhao Yuanzhou.

22:13.590 --> 22:16.000
He has been deceiving you all along.

22:20.830 --> 22:22.830
Here's a memory for you.

22:24.520 --> 22:26.280
Do you want to see it?

22:44.400 --> 22:46.170
Do you dare to see it?

22:58.180 --> 22:59.110
Li Lun,

22:59.140 --> 23:00.470
do you know your crimes?

23:00.720 --> 23:02.610
What crimes have I committed?

23:02.860 --> 23:04.720
You have committed three crimes.

23:04.950 --> 23:05.810
First,

23:05.830 --> 23:07.510
defying the authority of the Baize Token.

23:07.510 --> 23:08.470
Second,

23:08.470 --> 23:10.000
leaving the Wilderness without permission.

23:10.000 --> 23:11.000
Third,

23:11.160 --> 23:12.940
indiscriminately killing innocents in the mortal world.

23:12.940 --> 23:14.120
Zhao Wan'er,

23:14.550 --> 23:16.940
you are just a mortal.

23:17.290 --> 23:20.350
Who are you to interfere in the affairs of the Wilderness?

23:20.350 --> 23:22.320
I carry the bloodline of Baize,

23:23.310 --> 23:25.520
so it is my duty to protect the Wilderness.

23:25.520 --> 23:26.940
Of course I must intervene.

23:26.940 --> 23:28.810
Then I'll kill you.

23:29.510 --> 23:31.510
Let's see how you intervene then.

23:33.100 --> 23:34.290
Master!

23:36.670 --> 23:37.470
Wen Xiao!

23:56.590 --> 23:57.500
Freeze.

25:13.800 --> 25:16.120
What punishment will he receive?

25:18.540 --> 25:20.670
He will be sealed at his Place of Birth,

25:21.390 --> 25:22.850
repenting every day.

25:25.200 --> 25:27.800
For someone who yearns for freedom like him,

25:29.960 --> 25:32.320
that might be even worse

25:33.800 --> 25:35.600
than having his soul scattered.

25:37.180 --> 25:38.230
You can't bear it?

25:40.870 --> 25:42.320
I almost forgot.

25:43.000 --> 25:44.260
You're close friends.

28:17.130 --> 28:18.870
Go find her.

29:29.910 --> 29:32.450
♫A lone boat drifts through the world♫

29:32.490 --> 29:35.100
♫The heart feels bitter, then sweet♫

29:35.490 --> 29:40.510
♫Can't distinguish night from day♫

29:41.800 --> 29:43.730
♫At the edge of the dreamscape♫

29:43.890 --> 29:46.450
♫Someone is longing for♫

29:46.640 --> 29:47.710
♫Softly calling for♫

29:47.750 --> 29:51.860
♫A past that can't be brought back♫

29:52.230 --> 29:54.860
♫The world echoes with a single sigh♫

29:54.910 --> 29:57.440
♫Love and hate each fills half the heart♫

29:57.670 --> 30:02.680
♫The years are filled with grudges and grace♫

30:03.890 --> 30:06.020
♫The cry of summer cicadas♫

30:06.090 --> 30:08.650
♫The slumber of winter snow♫

30:08.820 --> 30:14.050
♫No idle wishes and no hopeless longing for eternity♫

30:25.540 --> 30:30.300
♫The flower in my palm♫

30:30.730 --> 30:35.880
♫Is everchanging♫

30:36.150 --> 30:40.990
♫Sand slips through fingertips♫

30:41.890 --> 30:46.890
♫Struggling again and again♫

30:47.570 --> 30:52.330
♫The sea of suffering has no end♫

30:53.250 --> 30:57.370
♫The spring breeze asks him♫

30:57.450 --> 31:03.190
♫What troubles turned his hair white♫

32:26.670 --> 32:28.250
But if one day,

32:28.750 --> 32:31.410
you find out I've done something unforgivable,

32:34.490 --> 32:35.880
what will you do?

32:38.910 --> 32:41.830
Most unforgivable things in this world

32:43.400 --> 32:46.730
are because we can't understand why the other person did it,

32:47.310 --> 32:48.970
that's why it's hard to let go.

32:50.990 --> 32:53.190
If you're willing to tell me the reason,

32:54.220 --> 32:56.020
perhaps I might understand you.

33:10.660 --> 33:13.400
If Zhao Yuanzhou really killed Wen Xiao's master,

33:13.400 --> 33:15.180
why didn't you tell us before?

33:17.100 --> 33:19.260
What's the fun in letting you know

33:20.170 --> 33:22.010
the truth like that?

33:24.720 --> 33:27.240
If you hold a grudge against Zhao Yuanzhou,

33:28.230 --> 33:30.990
you'll never be able to connect with him again.

33:32.910 --> 33:35.630
Then the Baize Token can never be merged,

33:38.160 --> 33:40.930
and I'll never be able to destroy it.

33:43.110 --> 33:45.060
To destroy the Baize Token,

33:46.080 --> 33:48.880
we need the most yin malicious energy in the world.

33:49.500 --> 33:51.340
When the blood moon appears,

33:52.150 --> 33:54.010
it will be extremely yin and evil.

33:55.670 --> 33:57.000
That's when we can do it.

33:57.360 --> 34:00.580
But now the Baize Token is split in two,

34:01.270 --> 34:04.270
attached to two different people.

34:05.430 --> 34:06.820
What should we do?

34:08.190 --> 34:09.639
We must make

34:10.360 --> 34:12.690
the two people who possess the Baize Token

34:13.610 --> 34:15.370
be of one mind.

34:27.010 --> 34:29.949
How do you know so much about this?

34:41.050 --> 34:42.820
I'm a person of my word.

34:44.800 --> 34:45.770
Here you go.

35:02.350 --> 35:04.100
You know the whereabouts of the Baize Token?

35:04.100 --> 35:04.900
Where is it?

35:12.310 --> 35:13.900
It's on you.

35:18.640 --> 35:20.250
This is against principles!

35:21.880 --> 35:23.330
Whose principles?

35:24.990 --> 35:27.920
Heaven's, the public's, or the law's?

35:29.300 --> 35:31.760
I only recognize the principles in my heart.

35:46.040 --> 35:46.980
Grandpa!

37:19.600 --> 37:21.930
I don't have time to play with you anymore.

37:22.890 --> 37:25.870
Zhao Yuanzhou will kill all of you anyway.

37:26.490 --> 37:27.580
Zhuo Yichen,

37:28.170 --> 37:29.450
don't forget.

37:30.200 --> 37:31.720
At the final moment,

37:32.870 --> 37:35.680
your Cloud Light Sword can kill him.

37:40.170 --> 37:42.530
I look forward to your decision.

38:52.450 --> 38:53.220
Grandpa!

39:02.680 --> 39:03.610
Mr. Zhuo,

39:03.950 --> 39:05.350
don't hesitate anymore.

39:05.960 --> 39:07.140
Do it.

39:34.810 --> 39:35.760
Zhuo!

39:35.790 --> 39:36.850
What are you doing?

39:43.730 --> 39:44.530
Ying Lei!

40:45.460 --> 40:47.460
The Baize Token has been destroyed.

40:48.500 --> 40:51.140
I have finally succeeded.

40:53.600 --> 40:55.340
However...

40:57.790 --> 40:59.690
Zhao Yuanzhou.

41:01.530 --> 41:05.400
If you really die at the hands of Zhuo Yichen,

41:07.140 --> 41:08.960
it would be somewhat of a pity.

41:09.900 --> 41:11.630
He's not worthy of killing you.

41:16.590 --> 41:18.600
Please make sure you keep your word.

41:19.030 --> 41:19.890
But I

41:19.990 --> 41:21.060
can't kill you.

41:21.230 --> 41:22.630
You don't need to kill me.

41:22.940 --> 41:24.280
Just suppress me.

41:24.940 --> 41:26.050
What should I do?

41:29.910 --> 41:30.880
Zhuo!

41:31.030 --> 41:32.090
What are you doing?

42:02.640 --> 42:03.560
Mr. Zhuo,

42:03.590 --> 42:04.760
it's up to you now!

42:22.580 --> 42:23.800
Apply the blood of

42:23.960 --> 42:24.890
the divine race,

42:25.070 --> 42:26.310
the demon race,

42:26.330 --> 42:27.780
and the Bingyi Clan

42:27.990 --> 42:30.320
simultaneously on the Cloud Light Sword.

42:30.570 --> 42:32.060
This will maximize

42:32.090 --> 42:34.100
the power of the Cloud Light Sword.

43:02.040 --> 43:02.900
Ying Lei!

43:45.860 --> 43:47.770
You still won't let go?

43:50.710 --> 43:54.070
Then I'll cripple both your hands.

43:55.370 --> 43:56.940
A few minor injuries

43:56.960 --> 43:58.740
are nothing to worry about.

43:58.930 --> 44:00.100
This blood

44:00.270 --> 44:03.550
will only make my sword sharper!

44:20.550 --> 44:21.790
Dream...

44:35.360 --> 44:36.160
Zhuo!

44:39.540 --> 44:40.340
Mr. Zhuo!
